Troubleshooting Tips
Problem: Command not found errors

Solution: Install coreutils package: sudo apt-get install coreutils
Problem: Permission denied when running script

Solution: Make script executable: chmod +x integrity-checker.sh
Problem: Checksum file not found

Solution: Ensure you're in the correct directory: pwd and ls -la
Problem: All files show FAILED

Solution: Check if checksum file paths match current directory structure
